  "description": "It's the five-year anniversary of the royal couple, Leedo (King Yongjong) x Haein. However, it seems as if His Majesty has been avoiding Haein as of late. The lady-in-waiting opens a meeting to help Haein find a remedy for the problem at hand and she, following their advice, tries to overcome the 5-year slump with a \"new attempt.\" Unlike ever seen before, His Majesty, for the very first time, has his arms tied together. Even though Haein is a little clumsy, her intention of teasing His Majesty is clear. The plan suggested by the court ladies and the ladies-in-waiting seems to make her heart flutter and is quite effective, but...\nSource: MU\nChapters 1-3 of The Collected Short Stories of Joseon Era.",
